# Free-form weather & next event (Oct 2026)

Match the home-panel hierarchy: **top-stacked**, left-aligned — not centered with a flex/`verticalWeight` spacer shoving content to the bottom.

## `weather` (`weatherNowNode`)

- Caption → small gap → row: `weatherStateIcon` + large temp (+ tune). Whole card taps open the entity card.
- Temp weight ~100 (light). Editor `.t-weather`: `justify-content: flex-start`, not `space-between`.
- Icons: HA layered SVGs via `weatherStateIcon` (same as forecast) — never bare `Present.weatherIcon` for this leaf.

## `nextevent` (`nextEventNode`)

- Stack: day (soft/light) → large time → gap → title → tight gap → meta (`calendar · location`).
- Default day colour `Role.INK_SOFT` (readable on teal fills); override with prop `color`. Ink prop for time/title; meta soft when ink unset.
- No `RcHorizontalPositioning.Center` / centered text. Editor `.t-nextevent` matches (no `.ne-spacer` flex grow).

## Detekt

Removing `verticalWeight` spacers → drop the unused `verticalWeight` import or CI `NoUnusedImports` fails.
